  sequenceId: 17F04_HomeGreeting_High
  notes: '17F04 terminal-side guardian-confirmation exchange (positive trust variant).
    Source: HEARTH_Full_Game_Script_Expanded_Native_English_Lobby_Mia_Commentary.md,
    stable marker 17F04_HomeGreeting_High. Text is synchronized by Tools/Hearth/Dialogue/Sync
