  lines:
  - startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Lily
    text: Mom? Are you coming tomorrow? Ms. Parker said it'd be better if a real
      person came. Not just a system check-in.
    holdSeconds: 9.074528
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Mia's Home Unit
    text: Mom will receive your progress report, and she'll make sure you have everything
      you need. Let's finish tonight's run-through first, okay?
    holdSeconds: 9.074528
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: The reply was filed under 'attendance confirmation, bedtime routine, concurrent.'
      Standard handling. You were at 17F-01 when it was issued. Please complete the
      confirmation.
    holdSeconds: 10.206603
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Mia
    text: I know.
    holdSeconds: 2.2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  postSequenceDelay: 0.18
